# The scaffold is tracked; the plan pages are not.
#
# A plan page is a working document: it quotes whatever was under review, which
# for this repo means live CRM records — real people, their employers, and deal
# terms belonging to a client. This repository is public. The scaffold below
# (template, DESIGN.md, README.md, config) is what another checkout needs; the
# pages themselves stay local.
#
# index.html is regenerated by the SessionStart hook on every session, so
# tracking it would leave the tree permanently dirty.
20*.html
shots/
index.html
